oghether? Do you think the Celestial Chorus and Verbena would gladly join hands in prayer? Do you think the Hermetics would invite some Dreamspeakers to their chantries to commune with the spirits toghether?<br /> <br /> What would another &quot;Golden Age&quot; be? Some awaken seeking enlightment while the commom men suffers again? The common people being subjected to crazy spirits, revengeful fae, self centered Mages and deceptifull vampires and furious werewolves? Is that the world you guys defend?<br /> <br /> The Mages had thousands of years to guide humanity towards a shinier future. But they were petty, snob, condescending. They failed. And that's why they lost.<br /> <br /> It's a new world order now. And in this brave new world, the old must go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12880-karlgust","name":"Karlgust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"614"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-27T16:09:33-08:00","id":1039147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karlgust</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1038176-is-mage-actually-more-appropriate-for-science-fiction-than-changeling?p=1039145#post1039145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> The propaganda of the Traditions, all that &quot;fight for freedom&quot; is a lie.</div> </div> </div> </div>No no, that's where your wrong. The 